						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Wanna take this to rants and raves where it belongs? Flame all you want, just do it in the right section. No, I&#039;m not a mod, but I come to this board to read meaningful stuff that people may put. If I wanted to read rants and raves, I&#039;d go to that section.</td>
