								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=2.0">Non-EQ (Hey Real Life!)</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1634.15#msg17900">Re: Something to think about</a>
