							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Where did I ever say I blame Bush for the problem with the levies? Where did I blame Bush for the damage caused by the hurricane? Guess what, I didn&#039;t. If you knew how to read at more than a grade 2 level, you may then realize that I&#039;ve brought up valid points about the rescue operations. The hurricane hit on Sunday, the first real effort to do anything happened on Friday. Figure it out, it isn&#039;t that hard to see it. As I pointed out in my other post, if this had happened to Florida, things wouldn&#039;t have taken so long (not saying Florida doesn&#039;t deserve the help when/if this happens), but I do think that ALL of the states should get the same type of response.</td>
